      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t this conflict if the record is a SRV record which conflicts with the service name, when there\u0027s no SRV record in the registration but there\u0027s a KEY record ?\n\nBasically, the use-case where the KEY record is used to protect against other services being registered with that name, even if they don\u0027t have a KEY",
