      "writtenOn": "2024-04-03T08:45:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As per chat, conflictForService currently implements the \"probing\" behavior, where it considers any record that has the service name as a conflict if there\u0027s no matching record. This CL should probably keep that behavior, so that if there\u0027s a KEY record that conflicts with the name, and there\u0027s no known matching key, it\u0027s a conflict.",
